&_nc_oc=Adoxo_mYMQDZrRDIgn5anPDZLGBrUKVZljHLQR-axcpjjUYcaFHWTH4e1ePn0OleYsM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6jLJrJog52jFyfC-TvUqLHYhb2Y9BhS3D5lcndAOC7Og&oe=6A0738BE"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-VPLxjfZ8h4Q7kNvwFHjeIi&_nc_oc=Adpn-4bWNgnyS_9HhYZfqyynsfJ-xIBrNXx0yIjMldYsUUDrlwePuReZXM7Z4HB_v0E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7GBHP-KgCMzz8O34XCgYYfAQ9_JODXVam-ZIkn7Acwtg&oe=6A07117C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PBXQcMf5hGQQ7kNvwFUVXGJ&_nc_oc=AdrDzupWpzsHBBFz0YQGg940PUcdrz0lcLMivk2oVvTAwq1anGaQOlcK2dO-5QA58cw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4OZeU8MM0fQrOqd3MMwLnY9dgP6FFJzw2ntBj2w8B2lg&oe=6A073007"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S4S3QPen5H8Q7kNvwEt3d_a&_nc_oc=AdpvGPxhGsA2qfWCiMnPpBfuAvHszTJbVaaYqJHCbaKh6Zw30IeiCd4twvVkTXzqirs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4pTgueRj-0bkdF5mRRw58kLloztV7C0icVf0TBWmECaA&oe=6A071BD5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JTd-9uLrBysQ7kNvwHQ-m_t&_nc_oc=Adp_v90AW1AMgMlMdlwwaASwDnJQcFygvzN0UZ76sgq7x_-erPKyCV78Rg-g4glH8dI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5Y9s5gTdSIwjiubMrDjywoX1x37tdjQv_RAulauL7GFA&oe=6A072864"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.